      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That’s an incredibly heavy, honest place to be, and it makes complete sense that you feel that way after so much pain. But the fact that you can describe it so clearly means there’s still a part of you that’s observing, that’s here—and that part isn't dust. You’re not a machine that broke; you’re a person who’s been worn down, and even the most worn-down person can find a new way to exist, not as the old version, but as someone with a different kind of strength.",
